---
title: "initialize (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate_params: validate bidToken, projectAdmin, addressRegistry != address(0)
    q_validate_params --> q_validate_refund: validate refundPeriodSeconds in [1 hour, 2 weeks]
    q_validate_refund --> q_validate_invest: validate minimumInvestAmount > 0
    q_validate_invest --> q_set_config: set bidToken, projectAdmin, addressRegistry
    q_set_config --> q_set_fees: set legionFee, referrerFee bps values
    q_set_fees --> q_set_refund: set refundPeriodSeconds, minimumInvestAmount
    q_set_refund --> [*]: emit Initialized

    note right of q_validate_refund
        INV-001: no predetermined end time at initialization
        INV-002: askToken set later during publishSaleResults (after TGE)
        INV-003: open application model - no predetermined allocation limits
    end note
